  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Register a new <a href=\"RedisListenerEndpoint.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpoint</code></a> alongside the <a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在 <a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a> 旁边注册一个新的 <a href=\"RedisListenerEndpoint.html\" title=\"接口 org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpoint</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a> instance for this registrar, may be <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "返回此注册器对应的<a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a>实例，可能为<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> to use.",
      "translation": "返回要使用的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> to use for payload conversion.",
      "translation": "设置用于负载转换的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>resolvers</code></a> to support custom controller method arguments.",
      "translation": "设置自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation 中的类或接口\"><code>resolvers</code></a> 以支持自定义控制器方法参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a> instance to use.",
      "translation": "设置要使用的<a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to use for payload conversion.",
      "translation": "设置用于负载转换的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> to use to configure the message listener responsible to serve an\nendpoint detected by this processor.",
      "translation": "将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> 设置为用于配置由该处理器检测到的端点所负责的消息监听器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> to use for payload validation.",
      "translation": "将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> 设置为用于负载验证的验证器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Register all queued endpoints directly with the underlying registry.",
      "translation": "将队列中的所有端点直接注册到底层注册表中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If no custom factory is set, a default one will be created based on the configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果未设置自定义工厂，将基于配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> 创建一个默认工厂。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides convenient methods to register endpoints and configure the underlying infrastructure, such as the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供便捷的方法来注册端点并配置底层基础设施，例如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> is used and it can be configured further to support\nadditional method arguments or to customize conversion and validation support. See\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> javadoc for more details.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>，并可对其进行进一步配置以支持额外的方法参数或自定义转换和验证支持。有关更多详细信息，请参阅<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>的 JavaDoc。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the underlying <a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a> is already active, the endpoint is registered and started\nimmediately. Otherwise, it is queued and registered once the registry becomes active.",
      "translation": "如果底层的<a href=\"RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a>已经处于活动状态，则端点会立即注册并启动；否则，该端点将被加入队列，并在注册表变为活动状态时进行注册。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">setBeanFactory</a></code> 接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>",
      "count": 1
